 token-cost-delta metric is not confounded.","cohort":["T8"],"criteria":["T8"],"decision":"block","decision_margin":0.175,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["step 5B: 'plus an exclusion summary injected into the verifier prompt'","gate_ops.py:229 wraps context as `<untrusted_ticket_context>` — an explicitly untrusted fence; directive-shaped exclusion text placed here is treated as data, not honored, potentially voiding the treatment effect","completion_banking.py:99-109 successor_system_prompt is a 'byte-stable cacheable prefix ... so the automatic prompt cache hits'; per-attempt volatile injection there would break cache prefix and distort the token-cost-delta metric (step 6)","ABSENCE: plan does not name the injection seam, delimiter, or trusted/untrusted placement"],"finding":"The treatment arm injects an exclusion summary 'into the verifier prompt' but never specifies WHICH seam, and the two real seams each nullify or distort the experiment: the untrusted_ticket_context fence treats directive text ('already searched, found nothing: ...') as inert data (prompt-injection hygiene), while the byte-stable successor system prompt is the cacheable prefix that step-6's token-cost metric depends on.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"fb2e28fe01d11db50","impact":1.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Protocol step 5B (TREATMENT); AC 'Verdict comment'","norm_id":"nd010044385e334ca","priority":0.875,"reason":"high-priority+criterion-opted-in","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Exclusion summary placed in the untrusted fence: verifier ignores it as data, treatment shows no effect, experiment reads as spurious NO-GO","Exclusion summary placed in the system prompt: breaks byte-stable cache prefix, inflating measured token cost and confounding the cost-delta metric"],"severity":"critical","suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.875,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"insufficient","cla